# Copy to .env (gitignored). Never commit real values.
# Must equal ANVIL_DEMO_TOKEN in the repo-root .env (the API answers 401/503 otherwise).
VITE_DEMO_TOKEN=sk-anvil-local-change-me
# Do NOT set VITE_API_BASE for local use: the app then calls the relative /api path, which Vite proxies to the API on
# 127.0.0.1:8000 (vite.config.ts), and `npm test` expects that. An absolute value made 13 frontend tests fail (ANVIL-101).
# VITE_API_BASE=
